How it reads: &quot;All pods. Both directions are restricted. Nothing may come in (no <code>ingress:</code> section). Going out, only port 53 is allowed.&quot;
 <code>egress:</code> starts in the same column as <code>policyTypes:</code>.
 Save, then:

flow.t:
Corefile: |
  .:53 {
      errors
      health {
         lameduck 5s
      }
      ready
      kubernetes cluster.local in-addr.arpa ip6.arpa {

