How it reads: - <code>envFrom</code> → &quot;take every key of ConfigMap <code>app-cfg</code> and make it an environment variable&quot; - <code>volumes</code> → &quot;this pod has storage called <code>db</code>, and its content is Secret <code>db-sec</code>&quot; - <code>volumeMounts</code> → &quot;show storage <code>db</code> inside the container at <code>/etc/db</code>&quot;
 <code>db</code> is just a linking name you choose. It must be the same in both blocks.
